  "description": "The META POWER TR V4 BOSCH RACE is a high-performance assembly with trusty ROCKSHOX suspension.\n• The ROCKSHOX Lyrik Ultimate fork combines all the American brand’s expertise: DebonAir+ air spring, ButterCups, and decompression valves. At the back, the ROCKSHOX SuperDeluxe Ultimate Coil shock, with its high- and low-speed compression settings. The hydraulic stop adjustment ensures a smooth end of travel.\n• This setup features TRP DH-R Evo discs and TRP rotors with a diameter of 220mm and 2.3mm thickness.\n• Wheels come in the form of the DT SWISS HX1700, specifically designed for e-MTB use and hand-assembled by DT SWISS.\n• The SRAM GX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain offers a 10-52 ratio perfect for steep climbs and varied terrain.",
